  "remote_sensors": null,
  "setup": [
   "Default gateway IP address is 192.168.1.8; change it on the gateway web page, then set a BACnet network number between 2 and 254 (unique per gateway) and restart the gateway for it to take effect.",
   "Unit device instances follow the network/port/address formula in the notes."
  ],
  "gotchas": [
   "Outdoor device instances add 100 to the port block (network x 10000 + port x 1000 + 100 + address)."
